{
  "slug": "angel-ai",
  "name": "Angel Ai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This Plugin acts as a data analyst agent. The goal is to minimize costs as much as possible for early stage startups, so they can make informed decisions at a lower cost.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `check-config` (Validate required API keys and configuration for the requested Angel AI task), `init-project` (Initialize the user's project directory for Angel AI runtime use), `run-report` (Run an Angel AI workflow and generate a final PDF report)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install angel-ai@claude-community` from `ShayanShams8/AngelAI`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
